9f7cd3a3-9c17-4930-8234-6d52aa56ad1d	fcfd2e31-637b-466b-b533-df70f7f1b3af	The 10 Best Construction Management Platforms of August 2025: Why Brikly Leads the Pack - twitter	New study reveals Brikly leads construction software in 2025! 90% platform completeness at just $350/mo unlimited users makes it the clear winner for SMB contractors. Ready to transform your construction business?\nAlternative version:\nThe future of construction management is here! Study of 200+ pros shows Brikly outperforming 50+ platforms for SMBs. Enterprise features without enterprise complexity. Time to upgrade your toolset?\n\nhttps://brikly.net/blog/the-10-best-construction-management-platforms-of-august-2025-why-brikly-leads-the-pack	text	"[]"	"[{\\"platform\\":\\"twitter\\"}]"	\N	\N	draft	{}	\N	\N	2025-07-25 14:54:41.650596+00	2025-07-25 14:54:41.650596+00	0f91e0b7-ddd2-4dad-ad7b-3d339ffaee19	5bdd857d-c8d1-455d-b46e-96b2f137ef26
9b799d09-cd36-479f-8c7b-ca6dfbd33167	fcfd2e31-637b-466b-b533-df70f7f1b3af	The 10 Best Construction Management Platforms of August 2025: Why Brikly Leads the Pack - linkedin	🏗️ The construction software landscape is evolving rapidly, with the market projected to hit $27.16B by 2032. What's fascinating is how the industry has finally reached its digital tipping point - particularly for SMB contractors who have historically been underserved.\nOur comprehensive analysis of 50+ platforms and conversations with 200+ construction professionals revealed a surprising trend: it's not the enterprise giants leading the innovation charge anymore. The real breakthrough is coming from platforms that understand the "missing middle" - growing contractors who need enterprise-grade capabilities without the complexity.\nKey findings that caught my attention:\n• 90% of essential features can now be delivered without sacrificing usability\n• The price-per-user model is being disrupted ($350/month unlimited vs. $375+/user)\n• Mobile-first operations are no longer optional - they're fundamental\nQuestion for my construction industry colleagues: What's your biggest pain point in digital transformation? Is it still the software complexity, or have we moved on to new challenges?\nWould love to hear your experiences, especially if you're managing a growing construction business. What features make or break a platform for you?\n💡 Pro tip: When evaluating construction management platforms, focus on total cost of ownership rather than just monthly fees. The hidden costs of training and partial adoption often outweigh the subscription difference.\n\nRead the full article: https://brikly.net/blog/the-10-best-construction-management-platforms-of-august-2025-why-brikly-leads-the-pack	text	"[]"	"[{\\"platform\\":\\"linkedin\\"}]"	\N	\N	draft	{}	\N	\N	2025-07-25 14:54:41.733391+00	2025-07-25 14:54:41.733391+00	0f91e0b7-ddd2-4dad-ad7b-3d339ffaee19	5bdd857d-c8d1-455d-b46e-96b2f137ef26
