2d0174c3-3ccd-44d9-8d1b-ecabb148af5b	fcfd2e31-637b-466b-b533-df70f7f1b3af	7 Construction Project Management Challenges Killing Your Profits (And How to Fix Them in 2025) - twitter	98% of construction projects go over budget! 🏗️ Stop bleeding profits from preventable project management issues. Learn the 7 biggest challenges killing contractor margins in 2025 & how to fix them.\nAlternative version:\nStruggling with project delays & budget overruns? You're not alone. 77% of construction projects face major delays. Discover modern solutions to the top 7 PM challenges crushing contractor profits.\nAlternative version:\n🚨 88% of contractors can't find skilled workers & 70% face payment delays. Don't let these PM challenges sink your 2025 projects. Get actionable solutions from industry leaders.\n\nhttps://brikly.net/blog/7-construction-project-management-challenges-killing-your-profits-and-how-to-fix-them-in-2025	text	"[]"	"[{\\"platform\\":\\"twitter\\"}]"	\N	\N	draft	{}	\N	\N	2025-07-25 15:00:28.240914+00	2025-07-25 15:00:28.240914+00	0f91e0b7-ddd2-4dad-ad7b-3d339ffaee19	d129896e-c008-40c1-bb86-0c3ecf13193d
f55a82a1-6710-4372-8669-9412c220848d	fcfd2e31-637b-466b-b533-df70f7f1b3af	Risk Management - twitter	Still losing sleep over project delays and safety incidents? Proactive risk identification prevents 73% of costly delays while cutting insurance premiums. Start your 14-day free trial at brikly.net	text	"[]"	"[{\\"platform\\":\\"twitter\\"}]"	\N	\N	draft	{}	\N	\N	2025-10-04 16:00:51.399884+00	2025-10-04 16:00:51.399884+00	\N	\N
13ac43d0-47a6-42b3-ac44-44150176f92f	fcfd2e31-637b-466b-b533-df70f7f1b3af	Risk Management - linkedin	Still losing sleep over unforeseen project risks that could have been prevented?\n\nLast week, I spoke with a safety manager who discovered a critical structural issue 3 weeks into a $2M commercial build. The fix? A 6-week delay and $180K in additional costs. The worst part? Early warning signs were there – buried in scattered reports and missed during rushed inspections.\n\nHere's the reality: 73% of construction delays stem from risks that were identifiable in the planning phase. Yet most teams are still managing risk with spreadsheets, email chains, and crossed fingers.\n\nThe companies winning today have shifted from reactive firefighting to proactive risk intelligence:\n\n🔍 **Early Detection Pays**: Automated issue tracking catches problems before they become budget killers. One client prevented a $95K foundation issue by identifying soil anomalies 2 days into excavation.\n\n📊 **Compliance as Competitive Advantage**: Real-time safety monitoring and documentation doesn't just keep OSHA happy – it's reducing insurance premiums by 15-30% for forward-thinking contractors.\n\n💼 **Risk = ROI**: Proper documentation and safety protocols aren't just about avoiding lawsuits. They're about building the reputation that wins you the next big contract.\n\nThe most successful safety managers I work with treat risk management like a profit center, not a cost center. They're using integrated platforms to turn compliance data into competitive intelligence.\n\nQuestion for the community: What's the most expensive "preventable" issue you've encountered on a job site? How are you using technology to stay ahead of risks today?\n\nReady to transform your risk management approach? Brikly's integrated platform gives you real-time visibility across safety, compliance, and project risks in one dashboard.\n\nStart your 14-day free trial at brikly.net and see how proactive risk management can protect your bottom line.	text	"[]"	"[{\\"platform\\":\\"linkedin\\"}]"	\N	\N	draft	{}	\N	\N	2025-10-04 16:00:51.65846+00	2025-10-04 16:00:51.65846+00	\N	\N
