0aed59da-f300-433d-8d5f-f431fb81d26e	fcfd2e31-637b-466b-b533-df70f7f1b3af	Time Tracking & Payroll - facebook	Picture this: It's Thursday afternoon. Your payroll person calls in sick. Friday payroll is due in 18 hours, and you're staring at three different notebooks, a stack of timesheets that look like they survived a cement mixer, and Tony's hours scribbled on the back of a Dunkin' receipt.\n\nHere's the fix that saved Martinez Construction 8 hours every payroll cycle:\n\nMake GPS time tracking non-negotiable on every job site. Not because you don't trust your crew, but because handwritten timesheets are where money disappears.\n\nHow to start Monday: Pick your most profitable project. Have everyone clock in/out digitally with location stamps for just that job. Compare those hours to your usual timesheet chaos.\n\nThe difference? Real hours vs. rounded hours. Job site time vs. drive time. Actual overtime vs. "close enough" overtime.\n\nWhen your payroll runs itself and labor costs stop being a guessing game, you'll wonder why you waited. Tools like Brikly make this stupid simple with their 14-day trial at brikly.net - test it on one crew before committing.\n\nWhat's your biggest payroll headache? Drop it below 👇\n\n💼 Transform your business today! Get your 14-day free trial: brikly.net	text	"[]"	"[{\\"platform\\":\\"facebook\\"}]"	\N	\N	draft	{}	\N	\N	2025-12-12 17:01:00.722535+00	2025-12-12 17:01:00.722535+00	\N	\N
